# 1. COUNT()

Counts the number of rows.

## Syntax

```sql
SELECT COUNT(*)
FROM Student;
```

## Example

```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) AS TotalStudents
FROM Student;
```

---

# COUNT() with WHERE

```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) AS PuneStudents
FROM Student
WHERE City='Pune';
```

---

# COUNT() with GROUP BY

```sql
SELECT City,
COUNT(*) AS TotalStudents
FROM Student
GROUP BY City;
```

---

